# The Python pipeline needs no secrets.
#
# The studio web app (web/) does, once hosted. They live in web/.env.local,
# which `vercel env pull` writes; `producer sync` reads the blob credentials
# from there. See web/README.md.
#
#   MIXMAX_PASSCODE=        shared passcode for the studio (required when deployed)
#   BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=  private Vercel Blob store
#
# Optional, for running everything on one machine against a chosen folder:
#   MIXMAX_DATA_DIR=        local store folder (default web/.data)
